      "message": "Maybe I misunderstood the description. RWSIG has never worked for npcx9?\n\n\u0027memory mapped address\u0027 is mabye just RAM address? I thought of memory shared between a host and an ec, which is also called mem-map (e.g. host_get_memmap). Maybe you want to change the description to disambiguate it.",
