      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is how fizz \u0026 puff read a public key from RO: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/HEAD/common/vboot/vboot.c#49. They use npcx7.\n\nIt should work for npcx9 as well, right? Which impelemntation is better?",
