      "writtenOn": "2023-05-18T19:16:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I understand it the fizz/puff solutions don\u0027t utilize the [rwsig task](http://cs/chromeos_public/src/platform/ec/common/rwsig.c?l\u003d263) as is done for the other FPMCU boards (bloonchipper and dartmonkey). I\u0027m not sure which solution is better, the primary reason this path was chosen was that it allows the future [helipilot board](go/crvc/4451646) to remain compatible with the existing FPMCU boards while not impacting other boards. \n\nI\u0027ll spend some time digging into this solution as well",
      "parentUuid": "ec4ae983_e9696a46",
